{% comment %}
  The Premium path, consult first.

  Premium is not a product you can meaningfully buy cold — the whole service is
  built on a color profile that does not exist until the consult happens. So the
  consult is step one here rather than an upsell tucked in at the end, and the
  numbering exists to make the order non-negotiable at a glance.

  The consult price is read from the product so it cannot drift from what the
  customer is actually charged at checkout.

  Accepts:
    - show_heading {Boolean} Render the section heading.

  Usage:
    {% render 'cfl-premium-steps', show_heading: true %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign consult = all_products['premium-client-color-profile']
-%}

<div class="cfl-premium-steps-wrapper">
  {%- if show_heading -%}
    <h2 class="cfl-section-heading">How Premium works</h2>
    <p class="cfl-section-intro">
      Premium starts with a conversation, not a checkout. Once your profile exists, ordering is
      as quick as any other service we run.
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}

  <ol class="cfl-premium-steps" role="list">
    <li class="cfl-premium-step">
      <span class="cfl-premium-step__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <div class="cfl-premium-step__content">
        <h3 class="cfl-premium-step__title">Book your color profile consult</h3>
        <p class="cfl-premium-step__body">
          A one-time session{% if consult != blank %}, {{ consult.price | money }}{% endif %}, in
          person at the Tampa lab or over video. This is required before your first Premium
          order: it is the only way we learn what your work is supposed to look like.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="cfl-premium-step">
      <span class="cfl-premium-step__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <div class="cfl-premium-step__content">
        <h3 class="cfl-premium-step__title">Bring examples of what you like</h3>
        <p class="cfl-premium-step__body">
          Images you would be happy to hand a client, and ideally a few you would not. Vague
          direction produces a vague profile, so the more specific you can be about what you mean
          by warm, flat, punchy, or clean, the closer your first order lands.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="cfl-premium-step">
      <span class="cfl-premium-step__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <div class="cfl-premium-step__content">
        <h3 class="cfl-premium-step__title">We build and keep your profile</h3>
        <p class="cfl-premium-step__body">
          We write up your color, contrast and file-naming preferences and keep them on file at
          the lab. There is nothing for you to store or send us again. Every future Premium
          order is matched against it automatically.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="cfl-premium-step">
      <span class="cfl-premium-step__num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <div class="cfl-premium-step__content">
        <h3 class="cfl-premium-step__title">Send film in, get finished scans back</h3>
        <p class="cfl-premium-step__body">
          Same drop-off and shipping as every other order. Your scans come back extra large,
          corrected frame by frame, dust and scratches cleaned, named your way, and your
          negatives cut and sleeved — ready to deliver without opening Lightroom.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>
